 "name": "Follow Your Wrath",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/feature.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>At 17th level, you learned that nothing but your hatred against those that wronged you matters, and no one will stop you from going after them. When you enter your fury, you gain the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>You gain further damage reduction equal to half your level(rounded up) that applies to all damage types.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You deal three additional dice of damage whenever you score a critical hit with a melee weapon.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
